y could  rewind time by a few seconds it would  have a similar effect he would be able  to anticipate his opponent's attacks and  counter them by reversing time to before  the attack was even launched but  although this could be interesting to  see it would also be really overpowered  and pretty freaking broken unless there  were some serious limitations to using  this ability all of luffy's future  fights would lose their tension since we  know that luffy will be able to  outmaneuver his opponent every time this  problem could be alleviated if luffy can  only use gear reverse on rare occasions  or when the situation is particularly  dire but not all the time another way to  potentially alleviate the brokenness of  such a power would be to make it very  difficult to control which means that  luffy could actually lose control of  gear reverse and cause massive problems  for himself and his friends by messing  with time itself there is a decently  popular theory out there that states  that luffy could actually be the  original joy boy who ended up getting  stuck in a time loop for example he may  have unlocked gear reverse but he lost  control of the power and it eventually  sent him too far back in time all the  way back to the void century since luffy  doesn't have the ability to jump forward  in time he became the original  historical joy boy the man who fought  alongside the ancient kingdom the man  who left a treasure on laugh tale and  the man who left that apology on fishman  island the reason why roger laughed when  he got to laughtale was because he  realized that the man he had been  looking for hasn't even been born yet  and that is why roger says that he  wishes that he could have lived in  joyboy's time after all if toki's devil  fruit could bring her from the void  century all the way up to the present  time then who's to say that a godly  devil fruit like nika can't bring its  user back to the void century now of  course a lot of us one piece youtubers 